      "text": "Issue #48, “`RuntimeError` when requesting logprobs with Gemma 3 models,” reports mismatched logits dimensions. Its relationship to this task is inferred only from the shared gemma3.py path: this task edits a preprocessing docstring, not logits handling. PR #35, “humaneval.py: fix top_k type, remove rep_p, add qwen3,” concerns evaluation and sampling failures; it does not establish a reason for deleting this sampling TODO.",
