      "id": "comments",
      "title": "Clarifying existing wrappers and vision preprocessing",
      "claims": [
        {
          "text": "AsyncJob already imports and constructs Job, forwards its arguments to that constructor, and enqueues the wrapper. Replacing DynamicJob with Job makes the docstring point to the actual underlying class without changing queue or cancellation behavior.",
