      "status": "suspected",
      "classification": "defect",
      "description": "The newly documented bounding-box guarantee remains vulnerable to inherited floating-point ceiling overflow; this comment-only change carries the behavior over.",
      "trigger": "Mistral3VisionModel.get_image_embeddings receives a 1541×1000 image with longest_edge=1540, patch_size=14 and spatial_merge_size=2.",
